w\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-09-14\nValid as Of: 2025-09-14\nVersion: 2507\n\n--- Record 114 ---\nComponent: Edge Integration Cell\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Updates on Component Monitor\nDescription:   The Component Monitor page has been redesigned.  There's a new Auditlog Agent component available.  Selected metrics are now displayed for certain components.    See: Component Monitor\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-09-14\nValid as Of: 2025-09-14\nVersion: 2507\n\n--- Record 115 ---\nComponent: Edge Integration Cell\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: XML Threat Protection Policy\nDescription: The XML Threat Protection policy has been introduced to safeguard XML-based applications and APIs from malicious attacks. This policy enforces strict rules on XML data to prevent common threats such as recursive payloads, excessive node depth, and oversized payloads.   See, XML Threat Protection Policy.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-09-14\nValid as Of: 2025-09-14\nVersion: 2507\n\n--- Record 116 ---\nComponent: Joule\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Project assistant capabilities for SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition in Enterprise Portfolio and Project Management, to read the due or overdue activities in a Project, WBS Element, Network\nDescription: The following transactional project assistant capabilities are now supported in Enterprise Portfolio and Project Management for SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition.    Display due or overdue activities in a Project  Display due or overdue activities in a WBS Element  Display due or overdue activities in a Network    For more information, see Read Due or Overdue Activities in Project, WBS Element, Network.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-08-31\nVal